       (:PARAM NIL "test-key") " to use. " :PAR "The subforms of "
       (:PARAM NIL "keyplace")
       " might be evaluated again if none of the cases holds. " :PAR)
      (:ITEM NIL (:MACREF NIL "etypecase") " " :PAR "If no "
       (:PARAM NIL "normal-clause") " matches, a "
