     "For more specific details of how the " (:TERM NIL "value") " of "
     (:VARREF NIL "*print-escape*") " affects the printing of certain "
     (:TERM NIL "types") ", see " (:SECREF NIL :DEFAULT-PRINT-OBJ-METHS) ". "
